# Line endings that each kind of script needs, whatever the checkout's
# core.autocrlf says. A .sh with CRLF fails in bash ("bad interpreter: ^M"),
# and a .bat with LF can misparse labels and blocks in cmd.exe.
* text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
